==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Clown Base (Enemy Base)|Clown Base]].
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage aims to swarm you with high-DPS Darks on base hit. Luckily, these enemies can be dealt with using long ranged Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]. Additionally, if you can lure them close, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] can nuke a large portion of the enemy wave out of existence.

